{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie","id":973425,"title":"What is the Lie?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-20T15:15:19-07:00","id":973425,"title":"What is the Lie?","content":"Does it have anything to do with the God-Machine, or is it strictly a mage thing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T15:21:26-07:00","id":973431,"title":"","content":"The Lie is the Fallen World and everything in it (the mundane world, twilight, the shadow etc). The basic idea behind this is that in ages past, which may never have happened, two factions of mages warred in heaven and the winners broke time and rewrote it so that a perfected Mage society never existed. They also changed aspects of reality so that it is more difficult to be a Mage in the current version of reality. Hence mages live in a Lie created by others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T15:35:35-07:00","id":973439,"title":"","content":"The Lie is the rule of the Exarchs, the supernal gods of oppression and limitation, and the consequences of their edicts. Viewed narrowly, it encompasses the ways in which the human soul is fragile, shrinking in shock from the light of supernal truth: it's the Gate that opens the Abyss inside humanity's collective unity, whose hungry maw devours sorcery in a sort of traumatic parasitism. Viewed broadly, it's the body of circumstance, natural law and social structures that keep mankind divided, suffering, and fearful.<br /> <br /> The God-Machine's motives and workings resemble a material body given shape by the supernal shadow of the Lie, but they're not, by default, intertwined or related phenomena. It's more like convergent evolution. They are both self-aware, self-perpetuating occult systems that benefit from a cowed and ignorant populace. Dolphins have fins, but they're not fish; fins are just useful if you're going to live in the ocean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T15:42:48-07:00","id":973445,"title":"","content":"So you know how linear time and deterministic physics pretty much leave no room for the possibility of free will? That's a lie. You know how we are all separate individuals, isolated from each other's thoughts and experiences, and separated by intervening space? That's a lie too. You know that feeling of powerlessness, of being a tiny, insignificant speck adrift in an infinite, uncaring universe? All lies. The Lie is the supernal symbols of oppression woven throughout Fallen reality to keep humans from accepting their true potential - to keep them from Awakening.<br /> <br /> By default, it has nothing to do with the God-Machine. The God-Machine is a Demon the Descent specific thing that also bleeds into vanilla, and you can of course use it in other game lines if you can think of cool plot hooks involving it. But no lines besides Demon and Vanilla are written with the assumption that it will play an important role.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T16:03:50-07:00","id":973458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973445#post973445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So you know how linear time and deterministic physics pretty much leave no room for the possibility of free will? That's a lie. You know how we are all separate individuals, isolated from each other's thoughts and experiences, and separated by intervening space? That's a lie too. You know that feeling of powerlessness, of being a tiny, insignificant speck adrift in an infinite, uncaring universe? All lies. The Lie is the supernal symbols of oppression woven throughout Fallen reality to keep humans from accepting their true potential - to keep them from Awakening.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there's the root of the problem. It's not clear all those are elements of the Lie. I mean, the pre-Celestial Ladder people appear to have been individuals (unless the Fall altered all the evidence to fit the new reality, which is admittely quite possible). The Mastigos path is all about dissecting the problem of Free Will. You can seperate people out into their desires and what remains? It's not clear there is anything. That's before the simple fact that non-determinism doesn't leave any room for free will either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T16:28:56-07:00","id":973478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973445#post973445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By default, it has nothing to do with the God-Machine. The God-Machine is a Demon the Descent specific thing that also bleeds into vanilla, and you can of course use it in other game lines if you can think of cool plot hooks involving it. But no lines besides Demon and Vanilla are written with the assumption that it will play an important role.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that should read,<br /> &quot;By Default, it probably has nothing to do with the God-Machine and the reason it was built. The God-Machine is a Demon the Descent and it is a thematic setting piece in vanilla, and you can of course use it in other game lines if you can think of cool plot hooks involving it. But no lines besides Demon, Vanilla, and Requiem (VII) are written with the assumption that it will play any important role.&quot;<br /> <br /> Which is to say one possible origin of the Machine in whole is that it was built by the Exarchs to oversee the Lie and maintain it. Another is that the machine was built and used by the Exarchs to become Gods, and they flushed it along with the rest of the people into the fallen world where the machine has been trying to execute it's primary function make gods, but can't in the fallen world, and that has been driving it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T16:36:33-07:00","id":973482,"title":"","content":"Actually, I'd say the original comment is correct. By default it isn't a part of Mage the Awakening's cosmology. While I see parallels in the way it works with the works of the Exarchs and would probably use it in my games too, it isn't the default assumption of the books that describe the GM nor the Mage books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T16:38:25-07:00","id":973484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973478#post973478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and Requiem (VII)</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah. The 2e Vampire core presents several mutually exclusive theories and possibilities, of which one ties into the God-Machine. I wouldn't call that an assumption that it <i>will</i> play an important role.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:19:37-07:00","id":973513,"title":"","content":"Ask ten Awakened (or people), get twenty answers. As it should be.<br /> <br /> To contribute yet another answer: The Lie is the Abyss; the noise in the way of the signal. Without it, the Supernal would be evident to everyone and no soul would tremble in the Sleep. The Lie is the Quiescence; that sinister sympathy to non-reality lurking in the hearts of all mortals that rejects the possibility of the Truth of reality.<br /> <br /> The Lie is short-hand for whatever the Awakened see as wrong with the world. It's the wizard equivalent of the idea of sin; something that would not exist in an ideal world, and will not exist in whatever utopian vision they believe is to come. It's the Exarchs and their insidious control; it's all the falsehoods that get between humanity and Awakening, and the Awakened and Ascension; it's the Abyss and the grim unreality it represents. It's all these things put together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:26:02-07:00","id":973517,"title":"","content":"Awakening 2e describes what the Lie is, in the Introduction and in Chapter Two. No need for speculating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:31:50-07:00","id":973520,"title":"","content":"I'm glad rereading I wasn't completely off topic. Sometimes I jumble up Awakening 1E and 2E, not because I dislike 2E, but just because I played 1E for so long.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:51:48-07:00","id":973534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973482#post973482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, I'd say the original comment is correct. By default it isn't a part of Mage the Awakening's cosmology. While I see parallels in the way it works with the works of the Exarchs and would probably use it in my games too, it isn't the default assumption of the books that describe the GM nor the Mage books.</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't that just it though. No one knows why the Machine is? what it is actually doing? What the heck it's function is? Heck the machine might not even know the answers to these questions. VII is a mystery as things in Chronicles should be. IS it one thing? Is it another? Is the truth actually in some space between those two theories and a third? I love that about this game line. The lack of set answers. It makes the world seem more real, because nothing is cut and dry. It's all messy and grey and full of shades between black and Ghost Grey. Never Absolute Black, or Pure White.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:55:44-07:00","id":973536,"title":"","content":"Yes, but when someone asks &quot;what is the base conceit of X&quot;, answering &quot;I think it could be Y, it is in my head canon&quot; doesn't really help. The opening post asked &quot;what is the Lie&quot; and &quot;is the GM part of it&quot;, the base assumption in the Mage game is &quot;no&quot;. As I said, I agree that the GM being part of the Mage cosmology is entertaining, could it be a machine of the Exarchs, or an Exarch itself (I've mentioned elsewhere that I find Angels and Ochemata to be similar), but for the question as asked, the base assumption is no.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T18:19:04-07:00","id":973549,"title":"","content":"The GM is totally part of the Lie. One time he said he'd supply the soda and it turned out all he had was Mr. Pibb and RC Cola. If that's not a Supernal symbol of oppression then I don't know what is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12136-jacobkosh","name":"jacobkosh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T18:26:52-07:00","id":973552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jacobkosh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973549#post973549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The GM is totally part of the Lie. One time he said he'd supply the soda and it turned out all he had was Mr. Pibb and RC Cola. If that's not a Supernal symbol of oppression then I don't know what is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Proof the GM is a truly unfeeling monster, no wonder Demon's rebel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T18:42:21-07:00","id":973564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973458#post973458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think there's the root of the problem. It's not clear all those are elements of the Lie. I mean, the pre-Celestial Ladder people appear to have been individuals (unless the Fall altered all the evidence to fit the new reality, which is admittely quite possible). The Mastigos path is all about dissecting the problem of Free Will. You can seperate people out into their desires and what remains? It's not clear there is anything. That's before the simple fact that non-determinism doesn't leave any room for free will either.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's really pretty difficult to sort out what is and is not part of the Lie, since the Lie is woven into Fallen reality, and we can't really know for sure what pre-Fall reality was like. In this reality, this is the way things have always been. But we can get a decent idea by looking at the aspects of the Lie that the different Paths see through. For the Acanthus, it's about choice and consequence. They see that time is not a river, always flowing forward, but a tapestry still in the weaving, with the past as what has been woven and the future being unspun. They see that Fate is malleable, which means determinism must be a Lie. For the Mastigos, it's about boundaries - they see that all minds are parts of a greater whole, and the separation between them - including physical separation - is self-imposed, which means distance must be a Lie. For the Moros, it's about inertia. Everything is in motion, even ostensibly inanimate matter is alive with subtle vibrations, all things end and what we thing of as existence is just a temporary state between other temporary states. Therefore, self must be a Lie, as &quot;you&quot; are just a temporary state between &quot;it&quot; and &quot;it&quot;. For the Thyrsus, it's about ecosystems. They see how each individual organism contributes to a greater whole, which itself is a kind of super organism, the individuals that exist within it its organs. This tells us that all life must be interconnected and any appearance otherwise is a lie. For the Obrimos, it's about power. I'll be honest, I don't quite grokk what aspect of the Lie they see through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T18:45:29-07:00","id":973567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973534#post973534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't that just it though. No one knows why the Machine is? what it is actually doing? What the heck it's function is? Heck the machine might not even know the answers to these questions. VII is a mystery as things in Chronicles should be. IS it one thing? Is it another? Is the truth actually in some space between those two theories and a third? I love that about this game line. The lack of set answers. It makes the world seem more real, because nothing is cut and dry. It's all messy and grey and full of shades between black and Ghost Grey. Never Absolute Black, or Pure White.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's why I didn't say the God-Machine <i>doesn't</i> play major a role in any other lines, I said it isn't <i>assumed </i>to. Assumptions are wrong all the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T19:26:41-07:00","id":973591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973567#post973567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's why I didn't say the God-Machine <i>doesn't</i> play major a role in any other lines, I said it isn't <i>assumed </i>to. Assumptions are wrong all the time.</div> </div> </div> </div>huh? Oh wait. Yes Exactly. Yes Exactly assumptions are always wrong like how I assumed your meaning and was completely wrong.<br /> <br /> Oh and umm...sorry if my meaning was misconstrued. I was mostly talking to the OP and gushing. Honestly I just started playing in 2014, and love it and was expressing why I do, while helping the starting poster understand that the Lie and the machine might be connected, might not, but the real question becomes do you want them to be? There are theories out there and those theories may or may not have fragments of truth to them. Piecing them together into what is likely to be another, completely wrong but more correct than the other theories that spawned it, theory is half the fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T06:25:56-07:00","id":973804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/973425-what-is-the-lie?p=973564#post973564\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the Obrimos, it's about power. I'll be honest, I don't quite grokk what aspect of the Lie they see through.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Given enough power, man can accomplish <i>anything</i>. And when they don't have it, they can always grasp for it and take it through the sheer force of Will. Power isn't bad, that's an illusion created by those not wishing to see your full potential fulfilled. Power is a tool of Progress and an instrument of Freedom.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T07:04:06-07:00","id":973830,"title":"","content":"Dave Brookshaw:<br /> <br /> I apologize. I was trying to get information on the Lie without actually buying the book. Onyx Path supports almost twenty game lines and, much as I'd love to, I can't buy the books for all of them. However, Mage: the Awakening is on my Christmas list. :-)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T07:15:21-07:00","id":973836,"title":"","content":"In that case, go to the sticky thread for open dev spoilers at the top of this forum. The Lie was one if the earliest blog posts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":14,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","user":"Dave Brookshaw","date":". 09-21-2016, 01:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T09:35:39-07:00","id":973897,"title":"","content":"Thanks, Dave. Just read the Lie post in Open Development. That really clarifies things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T20:50:36-07:00","id":974210,"title":"","content":"hmm... can't find the page in 2e that refers to something like the god machine perpetuating the lie or something like that, near where it talks about exarchs or oracles... though IIRC it was only an option, just trying to find it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T05:56:17-07:00","id":974355,"title":"","content":"According to the Lexicon from Mage 2nd Edition:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Lie, the:</b> The force that tries to hide the truth of the Supernal Realm from Sleepers. A manifestation of the Exarchs\u2019 power in the Fallen World. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","name":"Zooroos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T10:55:37-07:00","id":974530,"title":"","content":"I made few months before some sum up on three often confused terms <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/813286-2ed-lie-dissonance-and-quiescence\">here</a> - with adding comic book examples. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/813286-2ed-lie-dissonance-and-quiescence#post813286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Lie</b> \u2013 collection of false facts about reality that Sleepers believe in. All of \u201cmagic does not exists\u201d, \u201cgod/goddess are not literal beings\u201d, \u201cthere is only this material world\u201d. Contrast to the Truth mages uncover in their lives after Awakening.<br /> <br /> <b>Dissonance</b> \u2013 effect of making magic more unstable by Abyssal Sympathy ( \u201cShard\u201d ) all Sleepers have in their souls. In 1ED known as Disbelieve, but do not connected to the convocation of Sleepers. Even Sleepers firmly believing in magic make Dissonance.<br /> <br /> <b>Quiescence</b> \u2013 also known as <i>Sleeping Curse</i>. Effect of Sleepers <b><i>instinctual</i></b> rejecting Supernal Magic, and forgetting about spell events. <i>Quiescence</i> is also harming Sleepers soul, lowering their <i>Integrity </i>trait ( i.e. making them a bit less emotional stable ).<br /> <br /> And I have probably the best definition of <i>Quiescence</i> and it\u2019s confrontation with general population <i>Integrity</i> in comic media. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Straight from <b>Dresden Files \u201cWelcome to the Jungle\u201d</b> story \u2013 just after Harry Dresden acknowledges that the he used magic to the Sleeper's face\u2026<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/bYmYjft.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/bYmYjft.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}